{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_356c63c6acb94d8da26175dd0e2f98ba","id":"pg_10f3eef6d35f5382a9d532660aeff42b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/nahimnasser-pu-docs-how-pu-works-md-9be54622ba1b-32660aeff42b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_d6d04531dd695cf690369442d4bf9348"],"title":"NahimNasser/pu/docs/how-pu-works.md @ 9be54622ba1b","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:22:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_356c63c6acb94d8da26175dd0e2f98ba"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0e12b42128982ccd353390ab600e8e309a961944f182f74c570567a2fd8517c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product is a single shell script, pu.sh, described as under 50KB with zero package dependencies, relying on curl, awk, common Unix tools, and an API key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0e8569c145933e4a051bdbecfc26e541704088fb667eb05bdb166e28387b44bd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"File writes and edits use mktemp temp files, preserve trailing newlines via sentinel capture, keep executable mode on edits, and edit requires a unique oldText match."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1f7a063cba3f8645c37209eec0ab806ab5ad9571b978a5d951bc326e3111df67"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"JSON handling uses targeted awk parsing rather than a general JSON parser or jq, a deliberate choice to keep the install dependency-free."},{"claim_ids":["clm_50ec630a018d822b3d13910c3143d12b3f61bcf341a99f98653a0a7f48b8ffd8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README references 30+ experiments in final_report.md on harness portability and an eval/COMPARISON.md feature-by-feature comparison against Pi, suggesting evaluation effort beyond unit tests, though no scored agent benchmarks appear in the provided slices."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b332f4c08569f771d957d3dbc900d04c5c9628cd47bf9bbbccb67c255028760"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The bash tool executes model-provided commands unsandboxed via a temp script; AGENT_CONFIRM=1 can be set to ask before each tool call."},{"claim_ids":["clm_69e27dce557db67449db79e4d67f34fbf5394ab99d65255b38ad6cc10c9b233f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented gaps include no TUI, no streaming display, no image input, no OAuth login, no native Windows support, and no general JSON parser."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7e58d101d574324e7e9c35aed41665f7c477d2d38a68ab75c0135466f164413c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent exposes seven tools: bash, read, write, edit, grep, find, and ls, described as a Pi-shaped tool surface."},{"claim_ids":["clm_92504300d97300e83c6850719c6f8c691918ecfae991857cb16ba0c2c8fe7f67"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"It targets two providers: Anthropic via /v1/messages and OpenAI via /v1/responses, with API keys supplied via environment variables or a first-run login wizard saving ~/.pu.env."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9e5e3e6575b1a0008d9254552127a72454431655ace264803f2f4fba9b73d181"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"It offers an interactive REPL with commands including /model, /effort, /login, /logout, /flush, /compact, /export, /skill:name, /quit, and !cmd for inline shell execution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cab2eb7aac798984571282d87c74a2a95754be62d32c5968fe6253d1e1b40deb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI accepts a one-shot task argument, an interactive multi-turn mode, and a --pipe mode for chaining agent outputs, e.g. piping a write task into a security review."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e496a4a437195d971538982c16ff16b00f3cd7acd2a9b1ccbe05874f394529eb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions persist to .pu-history.json for resumable memory and .pu-events.jsonl for event replay/export; long sessions auto-compact by summarizing older transcript entries while keeping a bounded recent tail."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0e12b42128982ccd353390ab600e8e309a961944f182f74c570567a2fd8517c8","clm_0e8569c145933e4a051bdbecfc26e541704088fb667eb05bdb166e28387b44bd","clm_1f7a063cba3f8645c37209eec0ab806ab5ad9571b978a5d951bc326e3111df67","clm_50ec630a018d822b3d13910c3143d12b3f61bcf341a99f98653a0a7f48b8ffd8","clm_5b332f4c08569f771d957d3dbc900d04c5c9628cd47bf9bbbccb67c255028760","clm_69e27dce557db67449db79e4d67f34fbf5394ab99d65255b38ad6cc10c9b233f","clm_7e58d101d574324e7e9c35aed41665f7c477d2d38a68ab75c0135466f164413c","clm_92504300d97300e83c6850719c6f8c691918ecfae991857cb16ba0c2c8fe7f67","clm_9e5e3e6575b1a0008d9254552127a72454431655ace264803f2f4fba9b73d181","clm_cab2eb7aac798984571282d87c74a2a95754be62d32c5968fe6253d1e1b40deb","clm_e496a4a437195d971538982c16ff16b00f3cd7acd2a9b1ccbe05874f394529e